{"id":"n68099-1-9","stage":3,"title":"오른발 · 右脚","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68099-1-9-1","ko":"오른발을 절름거리네. 어디 다쳤어?","zh":"你的右脚好像一瘸一拐的，哪里受伤了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오른발을","meaning":"右脚","explanation":"오른발：右脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"오른발","audio":"/audio/38c3ab16385f65bca564.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68099","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오른발을","audio":"/audio/0bdd54021b3ab73e14f3.mp3"}},{"text":"절름거리네.","meaning":"一瘸一拐","explanation":"절름거리다：一瘸一拐；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"절름거리다","audio":"/audio/4d2317555b8727c65b78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81769","senseId":"1","lemma":"절름거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절름거리네","audio":"/audio/d36bab9060357b4cde30.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳤어?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳤어","audio":"/audio/86ade1e1d41a865d3f79.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c3ab16385f65bc","term":"오른발","zh":"右脚","audio":"/audio/38c3ab16385f65bca564.mp3","entryId":"68099","definition":"右边的脚。","pronunciation":["오른발"]},{"id":"4d2317555b8727c6","term":"절름거리다","zh":"一瘸一拐","audio":"/audio/4d2317555b8727c65b78.mp3","entryId":"81769","definition":"一侧腿短或受伤而身体总是向一边倾斜。","pronunciation":["절름거리다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f10d41c95e15dd34cd92.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68099-1-9-2","ko":"걷다가 오른쪽 발목을 삐었어.","zh":"走路的时候右脚踝扭伤了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걷다가","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걷다가","audio":"/audio/3da05c52e1326a1117cc.mp3"}},{"text":"오른쪽","meaning":"右侧，右边","explanation":"오른쪽：右侧，右边","readings":[{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17252","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}},{"text":"발목을","meaning":"脚脖子，脚踝","explanation":"발목：脚脖子，脚踝；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발목","audio":"/audio/8bdf6c1c6e18700e7ba6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56817","senseId":"1","lemma":"발목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발목을","audio":"/audio/0545e06cce71fec22055.mp3"}},{"text":"삐었어.","meaning":"扭，崴，闪","explanation":"삐다：扭，崴，闪；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"삐다","audio":"/audio/98b004e562c23186c86c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61531","senseId":"1","lemma":"삐다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삐었어","audio":"/audio/0516a69c76a87bd85cff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"f594aa6a15b9381c","term":"오른쪽","zh":"右侧，右边","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3","entryId":"17252","definition":"人